tsrs-only: visibility changes for the effect-tsgo shim accessors internal/rules calls (no Go counterpart: the Go
shim reaches these unexported checker methods through extra-shim.json linknames). Each item only changes
`pub(crate)` to `pub`:

- Checker::is_symbol_assigned (Checker_isSymbolAssigned): the catch* rules (catchAllTagDispatchToCatchTag,
  catchIfTagToCatchTag, catchConditionalRefailToCatchIf, catchRefailToTapError, catchTagToCatchReason) only rewrite
  handlers whose parameter is never reassigned.
- Checker::get_symbol_if_same_reference (Checker_getSymbolIfSameReference): the same rules compare a reference with
  the handler parameter.

Both are also used by flatMapConditionalToFilterOrFail and flatMapToTap (and their helpers).

